{
 "_doc": "Words that carry a PICTURE. cat priority: action > object > document > person > place > org > money > concept. 'see' answers: what would a person SEE in real life? prop = the drawn prop that shows it (see props.json). Add a row when a new episode introduces a new thing.",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "box",
